/.settings/
/.idea/
/env/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# The planning record, and the working files of any tool used to write against
# this tree. None of it is shipped source and none of it is product: it is the
# scaffolding, and this repository is public.
#
# Ignoring the directory whole also subsumes four narrower rules that used to
# stand here, each keeping one research output out of the index: the latch-probe
# media, captured sign-in failures kept deliberately unredacted because the
# fields a redactor strips are the ones that diagnose them, and the scratch
# profile a live sign-in harness writes real tokens into. Those files were never
# meant to be committed and still are not.
/.planning/
/.claude/
/.cursor/
/.aider*
/.mcp.json
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/GEMINI.md

# Test-run artefacts
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# Default output of tools/build_addon_zip.py. Kept out of the index because the
# index is what the build reads: a committed archive would be shipped inside the
# next one.
/dist/
